{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-fc61a88b7e00","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-fc61a88b7e00","name":"蒜香酱油","category":"condiment","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/condiment/%E8%92%9C%E9%A6%99%E9%85%B1%E6%B2%B9.md","blob_sha":"fab1be7b31e7f622acef2a4626da0c13bbcadadf","details":{"introduction":"蒜香酱油是一道蒜香浓郁、咸鲜油润的家常蘸料，常用于白切鸡、饺子等菜肴的提味。大蒜和芝麻分别具有抗菌和补充不饱和脂肪酸的作用。做法极其简单，对新手非常友好，全程只需大约 5 分钟即可完成。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 蒜头\n- 白芝麻\n- 花生油\n- 酱油\n- 蘸料碟"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 蒜头 2 瓣\n- 白芝麻 5 克\n- 花生油 15 毫升\n- 酱油 30 毫升\n- 蘸料碟 1 个"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 拍碎蒜头\n2. 往蘸料碟中加入酱油\n3. 起锅，加入花生油，等到油温滚烫后加入拍好的蒜头，炸半分钟\n4. 半分钟后，关火，把热油倒入蘸料碟，用筷子搅拌即可"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去皮大蒜30g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）60g、白砂糖5g、大豆食用油10g；整份约100g。通用shoyu酱油，不含其他可选调料，短时煮制全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":184.25,"protein_g":6.792,"carbohydrate_g":17.888,"fat_g":10.492},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients","version":"87cd9df8b3324c6d","fdc_ids":[169230,174277,169655,171411]},"profile_id":"family-fc61a88b7e00-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-fc61a88b7e00","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-fc61a88b7e00","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-fc61a88b7e00-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"garlic","grams":30},{"key":"soy","grams":60},{"key":"sugar","grams":5},{"key":"oil","grams":10}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"87cd9df8b3324c6d","completeness":"complete"